---
title: "transferInvestorPositionWithAuthorization (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_verify_sig: caller invokes transferInvestorPositionWithAuthorization(from, to, signature)
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: signature invalid or not from legionSigner
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_ended: signature valid from legionSigner
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_not_ended: hasEnded == false
    q_check_ended --> q_check_refund: hasEnded == true
    q_revert_not_ended --> [*]: revert SaleNotEnded
    q_check_refund --> q_revert_refund: refund period still active
    q_check_refund --> q_check_target: refund period completed
    q_revert_refund --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodActive
    q_check_target --> q_revert_target: target address already has a position
    q_check_target --> q_transfer_pos: target has no position
    q_revert_target --> [*]: revert TargetPositionExists
    q_transfer_pos --> q_clear: positions[to] = positions[from], delete positions[from]
    q_clear --> q_mark_sig: mark signature as used
    q_mark_sig --> q_emit: emit InvestorPositionTransferred(from, to)
    q_emit --> [*]

    note right of q_verify_sig
        INV-001: Cryptographic authorization from legionSigner required
        INV-002: Same transfer preconditions as operator-initiated transfer
        INV-003: Signature is marked used to prevent replay
    end note
